{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510187","name":"夜兰【彩蛋】","desc":"夜兰彩蛋","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/23/24077343/d78632e625540b69ca4778ad65fb7007_2884135022085896297.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色名\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e4月20日\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"生日\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e岩上茶室\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"所属\"}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e自称供职于总务司的神秘人士，却又是总务司名录里的「不存在之人」。\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色介绍\"}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/23/24077343/79396e8f1225b66e201036e086dd2d8a_7847280306275943391.png\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/23/24077343/0abd8c971b6814e66e5ed50cc1f98b1a_3639589719921281811.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"ll2qqytobehT1761228043231\",\"child_ids\":{\"ll2qqytobehT1761228043231\":[]},\"contents\":{\"27u1qv5pcgT1761367271796\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：刚刚在聊送货的事？\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"3oharpd2dm6T1761367356989\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：矿石和植物…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"46c9qncs142T1761367950475\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：不错啊，旅行者。懂得用咬文嚼字的方式找线索了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：迄今为止。我都是以个人身份和「北大陆情报网」接触，和璃月总务司没有丝毫关系。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"4gkiikxh0wuT1761367526244\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：……\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：旅行者，你听说过「北大陆情报网」么？\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"4yp5wen53eT1761368015568\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：她愿意这样和璃…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"75iwhzry1hrT1761367273627\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：是什么重要的货物么？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8h42fv2wd5eT1761367330340\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：是一些含有「月矩力」的矿物和植物样本。我打算运回璃月，让总务司加紧分析研究。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8zzlzuca0g8T1761367442813\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：你是为这个专门过来的？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：这只是此行目标之一。另外一件事，则是来向「秘闻馆」的老板奈芙尔求购些情报…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：每次和这位老板打交道的时候，我都要做许多准备。无论是心理上，还是摩拉上。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"fxb8r3bhr56T1761367357774\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：需要这么秘密行动？\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"iot516lobmfT1761367523836\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：奈芙尔这里…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"jytab6i6yoqT1761367367107\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：嗯，你倒是敏锐。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：在那些植物和矿石的标本里，还有一些有关愚人众的画片。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：包括他们的研究所，目前的武器设备，还有驻扎营地的分布。虽然璃月和挪德卡莱相距甚远，但未雨绸缪总是好事。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"kfy6s0pp37lT1761367524643\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：会有关于璃月的情报？\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ll2qqytobehT1761228043231\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"llwbfvwejprT1761368016823\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：咳，和你这样合作？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"mi9fxcurshT1761367912037\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：我还以为会是总务司…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"n8wjg6xdjrnT1761368170413\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：不愧是你…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：花点摩拉，总比在奈芙尔那边挂上人情债好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：旅行者，如果你需要和奈芙尔打交道，记得要提高警惕。她绝不是一个…容易交心的人。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：另外，如果您见到我和奈芙尔在一起，那我们大概率正在做交易。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：如果你信得过我，就最好捂住耳朵，什么也别听，什么也别做。这样可以帮你避开不少麻烦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：话就说到这里，我也要去做些准备了，我们就暂且告别吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：…对了，说句题外话。旅行者，愿意的话，可以回璃月喝几杯茶。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：璃月山高岩固，就算来了几股妖风，应该也能挡住。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"n90vxlg658T1761367910985\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：等等，「你」是大买主？\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"nq3q7nxccefT1761367783018\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：无论怎么说，我也是「北大陆情报网」的大买主。少了我，她兜里的不少情报可就没买主了。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"o1yo1lpvohdT1761367771482\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：那她还愿意把情报卖给你么？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：呵呵，只要给够摩拉，她没有不卖的道理。毕竟生意的事情归生意，沉甸甸的钱袋子总不会招人厌。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"oihokjrmkxT1761367612790\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：这是…？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：简单来说，是一个秘密的「情报交换组织」，它的结构十分松散，也并无强力规章束缚。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：但里面聚集着各路消息灵通的人士，用各种「代价」交换着情报。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：那位奈芙尔老板，则是「北大陆情报网」如今的代理人。她所掌控的那所「秘闻馆」，也是「北大陆情报网」最主要的情报贩卖口。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：如果只是贩卖情报，那倒也算了。但据说…「北大陆情报网」在世界各地都驻扎着眼线，或是寻找到了能够为自己打听消息的合作方。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"rsrjiwzxnsT1761367699163\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：难道璃月也…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：在诸位同僚的齐心努力下。「北大陆情报网」的触手被斩断在璃月之外。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：无论是明面上派过来试图洽谈的要员，还是暗地里扎下去的密探，都被我们用礼貌的方法「拒止」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：在他们的地图上，璃月应该是为数不多的几块「未知区域」吧。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"uyjnt4wg0fT1761368074759\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：当然了。我的实力可是很雄厚的。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"wz6gqz3f0gT1761367700392\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"yoog6rcznvmT1761368093144\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：具体是指…？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：钱。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：很多很多，多到足够说服她的钱。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"zl8adi09r3dT1761367772198\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：那她不会对你不利吧？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：怎么会呢？奈芙尔老板可是聪明人，懂得一码归一码的道理。生意的事情归生意，沉甸甸的钱袋子总不会招人厌。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"上线时间\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8177","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8178","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"o1r99ypgo5mT1761228043252\",\"child_ids\":{\"o1r99ypgo5mT1761228043252\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8179","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"七圣召唤对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"jlqn5c4vce7T1761228043273\",\"child_ids\":{\"jlqn5c4vce7T1761228043273\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8180","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"ah5blw25kfdT1761228043278\",\"child_ids\":{\"ah5blw25kfdT1761228043278\":[\"r372u6mwfx9T1762315930523\"],\"r372u6mwfx9T1762315930523\":[]},\"contents\":{\"ah5blw25kfdT1761228043278\":{\"option\":\"对话一\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：接下来还有好几场恶战吧？你做好准备了吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：对我来说，要是日子过得太平淡，时间长了就会麻木。找些刺激的事来做，反倒能更清醒一点。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：不如我来抛个骰子？如果是我满意的点数，我们就接着挑战下去·当成消遣也不错。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"r372u6mwfx9T1762315930523\":{\"option\":\"对话二\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e夜兰：安全屋。我不太喜欢由别人为我准备此类设施，但聊胜于无。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：就算我很想一次完工，把你托我的探索工作全部干完…但这里的规则和我的体能好像都不允许呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜兰：你也适当保留点精力吧，累着不值。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8181","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生日","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"timeline_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"喝个茶…——2023-04-20\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e这世上总有那么些人，什么日子都不消停。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e经过好几天追踪，我终于抓获了一起走私案件的犯人，附赠了一番令他难忘的审问。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e凭他交代的信息，剩下的就好处理了。我只能说，拖到今天也算他们自己运气不好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e总之，事件算是彻底完结，可以好好休息了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e今天我已经不想再进行任何脑力劳动，多余的寒喧和慰问也可以免了。不如简单找个地方喝个茶…你会陪我的吧？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e案子的细节我是不会说的。至于其他的话题，见了面再慢慢聊喽？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"735\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/12/13/24077343/61506003840057a135ef845f58e54c8e_726195232540979369.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"烈焰花花蕊\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/735/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/735/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e烈焰花花蕊\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2132\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/1a39f6ace063c934217cba146fb79807_1479140086416719997.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"沾露虾仁\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2132/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2132/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e沾露虾仁\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/25/50494840/3f159996754549fc7a1e686102b3d65c_5346924758923489489.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/25/50494840/3f159996754549fc7a1e686102b3d65c_5346924758923489489.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/38191319\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e夜兰生日快乐｜随我来吧，二楼已经备好了雅座。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"],\"key\":\"\"}]},{\"tab_name\":\"几枝新花…——2024-04-20\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e前段时间，我心血来潮投了几枚骰子，从清单里选中了「蓄养花卉」这一项。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我想着给家里添点颜色也不错，就去花市选了几株花枝种下。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e但这些花刚落盆不久，我就被托付了几桩悬案。奔忙数月，只给花匆匆浇过几次水，本以为吃尽枯渴，只怕是开不出花了。没想到它们却颇为顽强，硬生生蓄出了数朵花苞。古时人说的「凌寒独自开」，想必就是赞颂这类坚韧的花吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e好茶已备，想来一同赏花的话，趁早。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"500759\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/01/31/75610764/adcb94f5bc8614c5c8325bf5f168bc77_3030189556584027851.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"沉玉仙茗\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500759/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500759/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e沉玉仙茗\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2132\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/1a39f6ace063c934217cba146fb79807_1479140086416719997.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"沾露虾仁\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2132/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2132/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e沾露虾仁\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/25/50494840/87f5ac28daeb926d305b468bd67d14df_7099294000831490410.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/25/50494840/87f5ac28daeb926d305b468bd67d14df_7099294000831490410.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/51779085\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e夜兰生日快乐｜每回都邀请你到茶室来小憩，可会感到无趣？\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"],\"key\":\"\"}]},{\"tab_name\":\"休假…——2025-04-20\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e近来情报收集还算顺利，个别人士的抱怨与哀嚎不提也罢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e聊点开心的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我给自己安排了一场旅行，枫丹果真是个度假的好地方。剧院的演出很精彩，所幸，像台上那样有着高超演技的犯人寥寥无几，否则会拖慢收工进度的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e原计划我还要多待几日，但很可惜线报先来了，真遗憾，一名普通游客的行程只好匆匆结束了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e但愿这次的「筹码」足够支付打断我假期的代价。否则…呵，谁知道呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e对了，临走前给你选了些伴手礼，味道不错。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e尝尝即可，甜蜜的东西…别贪嘴。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2132\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/1a39f6ace063c934217cba146fb79807_1479140086416719997.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"沾露虾仁\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2132/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2132/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e沾露虾仁\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"500470\\